    "A normal round has four tricks. Only the fourth trick wins the round. Winning an earlier trick lets you lead the next one, but does not win the round.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A normal round has four tricks. Only the fourth trick wins the round. Winning an earlier trick lets you lead the next one, but does not win the round."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine normale Runde hat vier Stiche. Nur der vierte Stich entscheidet, wer die Runde gewinnt. Wer einen früheren Stich gewinnt, spielt im nächsten zuerst – die Runde ist damit noch nicht gewonnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ace": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ace"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ass"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a Knock, Hold accepts the higher stake and keeps you in the round. If the stake rises from one to two and you later lose, you receive two strokes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After a Knock, Hold accepts the higher stake and keeps you in the round. If the stake rises from one to two and you later lose, you receive two strokes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Klopfen kannst du halten: Du bleibst in der Runde und akzeptierst den höheren Einsatz. Steigt er von eins auf zwei und du verlierst später, bekommst du zwei Striche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
