    "The stake starts at one. Losing a round normally gives one stroke. At seven or more strokes, you are eliminated. The last player remaining wins the match.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The stake starts at one. Losing a round normally gives one stroke. At seven or more strokes, you are eliminated. The last player remaining wins the match."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Einsatz beginnt bei eins. Wer eine Runde verliert, bekommt normalerweise einen Strich. Mit sieben oder mehr Strichen scheidest du aus. Wer zuletzt übrig bleibt, gewinnt die Partie."
          }
        }
